1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT When his mother died in 1790 the Søndre Ilen(bnr.3) farm in Askim was passed onto Klemet for 750 rdl.
2 CONT
2 CONT Klemet had farmed ovre Gudim from 1762 until 1785. Then he turned over Gudim to his son-in-law Erik Hansen and Klemet moved to the Dramstad farm. He Farmed Dramstad until 1790.
2 CONT Source Link: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000115191114857label=@S53@
