1 NAME Anton Johannesen /Johannesen/
2 GIVN Anton Johannesen
2 SURN Johannesen
2 _MARNM Fossum
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JAN 1873
2 ADDR
3 CITY Skien
3 STAE Telemark
3 CTRY Norway
