1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Klemmet Rasmussen was born in 1717. As Rasmus Sjøfarsen's oldest son, he was the one to inherit the family farm, Vest Garsegg. After his father died, Klemmet bought out his sisters' share for 230 riksdaler. Klemmet
2 CONC  died after he worked the farm for 35 years, and when his son Villum inherited Vest Garsegg it was worth 550 riksdaler.
